; Focused checks, built with the rest so a signature change cannot rot
; them silently.  Two exclusions, for different reasons: `Deep.v` is the
; one file here a parser edit should not pay for (~176s), and `Probe.v`
; is a falsification scratchpad whose `Compute`s print.  `make deep` and
; `make probe` run them.
